diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index bf4dc62..0b512e8 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -7,6 +7,24 @@ Every person registers and logs in, and sees only **their own** devices.
 - **Backend:** Node.js REST API (`server/`), built-in `http` and `node:sqlite`, no npm packages needed
 - **Database:** SQLite file created automatically at `server/data.db`
 
+## Interface
+
+![Dashboard](docs/dashboard.png)
+
+- **Summary cards:** device count, subnet usage bar (turns orange at 70% and red at 90%), static vs DHCP, and the next free address.
+- **Subnet map:** one square per address. Tap a free square to add a device with that IP.
+- **Add / edit dialog:** opens as a pop-up. Press **Esc** or click outside to close it. A conflict shows the owner and suggests the next free IP.
+- **Device list:** search (press **/** to jump to it), filter by type, click any column heading to sort, and **Export CSV**.
+- **Dark mode:** the moon/sun button in the header. Your choice is remembered.
+- **Mobile friendly:** the table becomes stacked cards on small screens.
+- **Login screen:** show/hide password and a password strength meter on registration.
+
+| Add device dialog | Dark mode | Mobile |
+|---|---|---|
+| ![Dialog](docs/add-device-dialog.png) | ![Dark](docs/dark-mode.png) | ![Mobile](docs/mobile.png) |
+
+![Login](docs/login.png)
+
 ## Requirements
 Node.js **22.13 or newer** (`node -v` to check). Node 22 prints an "experimental" warning for SQLite. That is normal.
 
diff --git a/client/src/styles.css b/client/src/styles.css
index 0010fdb..e83ad70 100644
--- a/client/src/styles.css
+++ b/client/src/styles.css
@@ -91,6 +91,7 @@ input:focus, select:focus { border-color: var(--brand); outline: 3px solid color
 .cell.free { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--mute); }
 .cell.free:hover { border-color: var(--brand); color: var(--brand); background: var(--brand-soft); transform: translateY(-1px); }
 .cell.used { background: var(--used); border: 1px solid var(--used); color: var(--used-ink); cursor: not-allowed; }
+.cell.used:disabled { opacity: 1; }
 
 /* ---------- device list ---------- */
 .toolbar { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 12px; }
